  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Transparency and Right to Information</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increased transparency and accountability, and reduced corruption in Bangladesh through smart advocacy and adaptive programming for policy, system and community change. Critical policy areas include - addressing health sector corruption and social safety net corruption (Transparency International Bangladesh); support to returnee migrants; increasing Bangladesh&apos;s access to climate finance and supporting poor people facing climate migration (British Council).</narrative>
  </description>
